---
title: "A member's points while an order is credited and a reward is redeemed"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Waiting for the order
    lg1: Order saved
    lg2: Points added
    lg3: Breaks BalanceMatchesHistory
    lg4: Path to the BalanceMatchesHistory bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Order not saved yet
  s1: Order not saved yet, reward redeemed
  s2: Order saved, no points yet
  s3: Order points added
  s4: Order saved, no points yet, reward redeemed
  s5: Order points added, reward redeemed
  s6: Order points added, reward redeemed, balance higher than the history (free points)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: an order delivery starts and reads the balance
  s0 --> s1: the reward's cost goes into the history
  s0 --> s2: the order is saved
  s2 --> s3: the order's points go into the history
  s2 --> s2: an order delivery starts and reads the balance or another delivery finds the order already saved
  s1 --> s4: the order is saved
  s2 --> s4: the reward's cost goes into the history
  s3 --> s5: the reward's cost goes into the history
  s4 --> s5: the order's points go into the history
  s3 --> s3: the member starts a redemption
  s5 --> s3: the balance changed, so the redemption is undone
  s5 --> s5: the balance had not changed, so the redemption saves
  s5 --> s6: the balance is set to the balance read earlier plus the points or another delivery finds the order already saved
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 tan
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 tan
  class s2 orange
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 orange
  class s5 teal
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
